---

<section id="contacto" class="contact-section">
  <div class="section-bar">
    <h2>Contacto</h2>
    <span class="folio-num">[ Folio 08 &ndash; Contacto ]</span>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-container">
    <p class="contact-lead">
      Si te interesa colaborar en algún desarrollo web, aplicaciones con Django o Astro, o proyectos con hardware en terreno, puedes escribirme directamente:
    </p>

    <div class="contact-details">
      <div class="email-row">
        <span class="email-label">Correo:</span>
        <a href="mailto:felipegp90@gmail.com" class="email-link">felipegp90@gmail.com</a>
        <button class="copy-btn" data-copy-email="felipegp90@gmail.com" type="button" title="Copiar correo">
          [ Copiar ]
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="meta-item">GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/felipooon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">felipooon &rarr;</a></span>
        <span class="meta-item">Ubicación: Puerto Montt, Región de Los Lagos, Chile</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact-section {
    margin-bottom: 4.5rem;
  }

  .contact-container {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-dark);
    padding: 1.75rem;
  }

  .contact-lead {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .contact-details {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px dotted var(--border);
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .email-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .email-label {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .email-link {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
  }

  .email-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent-hover);
  }

  .copy-btn {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .copy-btn:hover {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .meta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .meta-row a {
    color: var(--text);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-dark);
  }

  .meta-row a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .contact-container { padding: 1.25rem; }
    .meta-row { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.35rem; }
  }
</style>
